div.p:
5157. Subj: SYG—SC
                    Second Ballot December 20. Ref: (A) USUN 5149;
                    (B) State 227889.

item.p:
                            SC voted one by one on separate ballots
                            through list of ten candidates. Results announced at end as follows: 


                                    Amerasinghe (4–6–5);
                                        Djermakoye
                                    (5–8–2);


                                    Herrera (7–6–2); Jakobson (9–5 (including one
                                    veto)–1);


                                    Jarring (7–4–4);
                                        Ortiz de Rozas (10–3
                                    (one veto)–2);


                                    Rahnema (3–8–4); Ramphal (3–7–5);

Valdes (7–5–3); Waldheim
                                    (11–2 (one veto)–2).
